<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Kolon Industries H1 net soars.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Kolon Industries H1 net soars.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		 907    vs	307</p>
<p>    Net		     12.08    vs     2.77</p>
<p>    Profit before tax   14.59    vs     3.25</p>
<p>    Turnover	     524.05    vs   458.61</p>
<p>Note - Kolon Industries Inc is South Korea's leading synthetic fibre producer. The Korea Listed Companies Association provided the figures but gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
</text>
